    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shove, stomp, slice, and shoot your way through an endless horde of zombies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/b2d56cb7c3f11be2b285766b9dc489ab.poster.avif?t=1745923982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/b2d56cb7c3f11be2b285766b9dc489ab.webm?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/b2d56cb7c3f11be2b285766b9dc489ab.mp4?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deaded The Runner is a roguelike small top down single player action shooter where you attempt to travel as deep as you can through the inner cities, all the while fending off an endless horde of Zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/46d583274f593da991aeaad9ad840951.poster.avif?t=1745923982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/46d583274f593da991aeaad9ad840951.webm?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/46d583274f593da991aeaad9ad840951.mp4?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to stay on your toes, you only have one life, with each kill granting a random item, adapt to the weapon you're given and make every action count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Zombies arent your only challenge. Guns may cost bullets but melee attacks will cost stamina! You'll have to manage drinking water and eating food to keep your stamina regeneration up.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/f0b678e81e6f719e9bc64056267be2a4.poster.avif?t=1745923982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/f0b678e81e6f719e9bc64056267be2a4.webm?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/f0b678e81e6f719e9bc64056267be2a4.mp4?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Further you travel, difficulty increases. How Far Will You Survive.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shove, stomp, slice, and shoot your way through an endless horde of zombies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/b2d56cb7c3f11be2b285766b9dc489ab.poster.avif?t=1745923982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/b2d56cb7c3f11be2b285766b9dc489ab.webm?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/b2d56cb7c3f11be2b285766b9dc489ab.mp4?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deaded The Runner is a roguelike small top down single player action shooter where you attempt to travel as deep as you can through the inner cities, all the while fending off an endless horde of Zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/46d583274f593da991aeaad9ad840951.poster.avif?t=1745923982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/46d583274f593da991aeaad9ad840951.webm?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/46d583274f593da991aeaad9ad840951.mp4?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to stay on your toes, you only have one life, with each kill granting a random item, adapt to the weapon you're given and make every action count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Zombies arent your only challenge. Guns may cost bullets but melee attacks will cost stamina! You'll have to manage drinking water and eating food to keep your stamina regeneration up.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/f0b678e81e6f719e9bc64056267be2a4.poster.avif?t=1745923982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/f0b678e81e6f719e9bc64056267be2a4.webm?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/extras/f0b678e81e6f719e9bc64056267be2a4.mp4?t=1745923982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Further you travel, difficulty increases. How Far Will You Survive.</p>",
